# Troll Shaman — a Typical enemy of the 1997 game, the deck as the original shipped it.
# tier: 3/12 Typical enemies — 14 life, bribe 60 gold
# enemy: Troll Shaman (1997 in-game name, s30/assets/text/Advstrings.txt @CREATURENAMES)
# designer: Coyote Tex, MicroProse designer/producer — every enemy deck (precon page, ref. 2)
# variant: Original (base game; the enemy deck files are dated 19 September 1996)
# source: ../shandalar-src/Decks.zip:Decks/0261.dck "Troll Shaman (Re, 4th)" [Tier 3 — Manalink
#   3 file dated 2016-02-15; its first 14 maindeck lines are the 1997 deck, the 11 lines (60
#   cards) after them are the modern deck Manalink appended and are NOT shipped; its
#   .vNone/.v<Colour> sections are the 1997 colour-keyed swaps]
# source: ../s30/assets/configs/rogues/troll_shaman.toml (main_cards, sideboard_cards, level 3)
#   [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix above]
# source: ../mage-go/rogue_dck/troll_shaman.dck [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix]
# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Enemy_Decks_(Typical) — "Troll Shaman" (Original)
#   [Tier-web — maindeck agrees]
# group: 1997 originals
name: Troll Shaman
22 Mountain
2 Strip Mine
2 Lightning Bolt
2 Conservator
3 Fireball
4 Stone Giant
4 Hill Giant
2 Gray Ogre
4 Uthden Troll
3 The Brute
3 Eternal Warrior
2 Hurloon Minotaur
2 Oasis
2 Dancing Scimitar
2 Shatter
1 Shivan Dragon
# The 1997 file's colour-keyed sideboard sections. The AI played the maindeck WITHOUT
# .vNone plus the one section matching the player's deck colour (.vNone by default);
# .vNone is folded into the maindeck above, and SB: holds, per name, the largest
# colour-section count minus the .vNone count — the smallest sideboard from which
# every 1997 configuration can be rebuilt by swapping.
#   .vNone   2 Shatter, 1 Shivan Dragon
#   .vBlack  2 Shatter, 1 Throne of Bone
#   .vBlue   1 Shatter, 1 Red Elemental Blast, 1 Shivan Dragon
#   .vGreen  2 Shatter, 1 Wooden Sphere
#   .vRed    1 Burrowing, 1 Shatter, 1 Shivan Dragon
#   .vWhite  1 Ivory Cup, 1 Celestial Prism, 1 Colossus of Sardia
SB: 1 Throne of Bone
SB: 1 Red Elemental Blast
SB: 1 Wooden Sphere
SB: 1 Burrowing
SB: 1 Ivory Cup
SB: 1 Celestial Prism
SB: 1 Colossus of Sardia
